WEBVTT

00:09:57.525 --> 00:10:00.597
Shouldn't we save everything
we can on the lifeboats?

00:10:01.357 --> 00:10:07.438
(Applause)

00:10:09.754 --> 00:10:13.217
Looking at my scans
from Honduras and Mexico,

00:10:13.241 --> 00:10:16.550
it's clear that we need
to scan, scan, scan

00:10:16.574 --> 00:10:18.981
now as much as possible,

00:10:19.005 --> 00:10:20.430
while we still can.

00:10:21.128 --> 00:10:23.622
That's what inspired the Earth Archive,

00:10:23.646 --> 00:10:26.283
an unprecedented scientific effort

00:10:26.307 --> 00:10:29.027
to LiDAR-scan the entire planet,

00:10:29.051 --> 00:10:31.343
starting with areas
that are most threatened.